<!--
  Notification small icon.

  Android renders notification small icons using ONLY the alpha channel, every
  non-transparent pixel is drawn in a single system colour. So this must be a
  flat white silhouette on transparent, never a full-colour icon.

  The previous code passed R.mipmap.ic_launcher here, which is why the
  notification icon rendered as a solid white blob on most devices.
-->
